 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "h",
   "es": "1 · Llegada a la clase (sábado, 10:00)",
   "en": ""
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Hola, buenos días. ¿Es aquí la clase de cocina?",
   "en": "Hi, good morning. Is the cooking class here?",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c1_01_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Sí! Bienvenida. ¿Cómo te llamas?",
   "en": "Yes! Welcome. What's your name?",
   "who": "Profesora",
   "audio": "audio/c1_02_Profesora.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Me llamo Marina. Es mi primera clase.",
   "en": "My name is Marina. It's my first class.",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c1_03_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Encantada, Marina. ¿Estás nerviosa?",
   "en": "Nice to meet you, Marina. Are you nervous?",
   "who": "Profesora",
   "audio": "audio/c1_04_Profesora.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Un poco nerviosa, pero también contenta.",
   "en": "A little nervous, but also happy.",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c1_05_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Tranquila. Hoy preparamos una tortilla de patatas.",
   "en": "Don't worry. Today we're making a Spanish omelette.",
   "who": "Profesora",
   "audio": "audio/c1_06_Profesora.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Qué bien! ¿[[c1_que_necesitamos|Qué necesitamos]]?",
   "en": "Great! What do we need?",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c1_07_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Huevos, patatas, cebolla y aceite de oliva.",
   "en": "Eggs, potatoes, onion and olive oil.",
   "who": "Profesora",
   "audio": "audio/c1_08_Profesora.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Vale. ¿Dónde dejo mi bolsa?",
   "en": "OK. Where do I leave my bag?",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c1_09_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Aquí, en la silla. Y ponte este delantal blanco.",
   "en": "Here, on the chair. And put on this white apron.",
   "who": "Profesora",
   "audio": "audio/c1_10_Profesora.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Gracias. ¿Me lavo las manos primero?",
   "en": "Thanks. Do I wash my hands first?",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c1_11_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí, con agua y jabón. Muy bien.",
   "en": "Yes, with soap and water. Very good.",
   "who": "Profesora",
   "audio": "audio/c1_12_Profesora.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡[[c1_vale_empiezo|Vale, empiezo]]!",
   "en": "OK, I'm starting!",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c1_13_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "h",
   "es": "2 · Con Laura (las patatas se cocinan)",
   "en": ""
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Hola, me llamo Laura. ¿[[c2_eres_nueva|Eres nueva]]?",
   "en": "Hi, my name is Laura. Are you new?",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c2_01_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí, hola. Soy Marina. ¿Y tú?",
   "en": "Yes, hi. I'm Marina. And you?",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c2_02_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "[[c2_yo_tambien|Yo también]] soy nueva en la clase.",
   "en": "I'm new in the class too.",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c2_03_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Qué bien! Ya no estoy tan nerviosa.",
   "en": "Great! I'm not so nervous now.",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c2_04_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Mmm! [[c2_todo_huele_bien|Todo huele bien]].",
   "en": "Mmm! Everything smells good.",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c2_05_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí. Las patatas se cocinan despacio.",
   "en": "Yes. The potatoes are cooking slowly.",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c2_06_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿Cortas tú la cebolla?",
   "en": "Will you cut the onion?",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c2_07_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Vale. La corto despacio, con cuidado.",
   "en": "OK. I'll cut it slowly, carefully.",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c2_08_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Yo bato los huevos en el bol.",
   "en": "I'll beat the eggs in the bowl.",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c2_09_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Perfecto. ¿Cocinas mucho en casa?",
   "en": "Perfect. Do you cook a lot at home?",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c2_10_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "No mucho. Por eso [[c2_quiero_aprender|quiero aprender]].",
   "en": "Not much. That's why I want to learn.",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c2_11_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Yo también. ¡Tengo curiosidad!",
   "en": "Me too. I'm curious!",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c2_12_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Pues a cocinar!",
   "en": "Well then, let's cook!",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c2_13_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "h",
   "es": "3 · Dar la vuelta (¡menudo lío!)",
   "en": ""
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Ahora, [[c3_con_cuidado|con cuidado]]. Coge un plato grande.",
   "en": "Now, carefully. Take a large plate.",
   "who": "Profesora",
   "audio": "audio/c3_01_Profesora.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿Este plato?",
   "en": "This plate?",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c3_02_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí. Ponlo sobre la sartén.",
   "en": "Yes. Put it over the frying pan.",
   "who": "Profesora",
   "audio": "audio/c3_03_Profesora.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Vale. ¿Y ahora?",
   "en": "OK. And now?",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c3_04_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Ahora, dale la vuelta. ¡Rápido!",
   "en": "Now, flip it over. Quickly!",
   "who": "Profesora",
   "audio": "audio/c3_05_Profesora.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Ay! Un trozo se separa. ¡[[c3_menudo_lio|Menudo lío]]!",
   "en": "Oh! A piece is breaking off. What a mess!",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c3_06_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "[[c3_no_pasa_nada|No pasa nada]]. Es normal la primera vez.",
   "en": "It doesn't matter. It's normal the first time.",
   "who": "Profesora",
   "audio": "audio/c3_07_Profesora.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿Qué hago ahora?",
   "en": "What do I do now?",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c3_08_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Pon la tortilla otra vez en la sartén.",
   "en": "Put the omelette back in the frying pan.",
   "who": "Profesora",
   "audio": "audio/c3_09_Profesora.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿Cocinamos un [[c3_poco_mas|poco más]]?",
   "en": "Shall we cook it a little more?",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c3_10_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí. Mira, ya está dorada.",
   "en": "Yes. Look, it's golden now.",
   "who": "Profesora",
   "audio": "audio/c3_11_Profesora.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "No es redonda, pero está hecha.",
   "en": "It's not round, but it's cooked.",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c3_12_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "h",
   "es": "4 · En la mesa larga",
   "en": ""
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Por fin! Vamos a [[c4_probar|probar]] la tortilla.",
   "en": "At last! Let's try the omelette.",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c4_01_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí. Pruebo un trozo… ¡[[c4_esta_de_muerte|Está de muerte]]!",
   "en": "Yes. I'll try a piece… It's amazing!",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c4_02_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Es verdad! Está caliente y muy rica.",
   "en": "It's true! It's hot and very tasty.",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c4_03_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "No es perfecta, ¡pero está buenísima!",
   "en": "It isn't perfect, but it's delicious!",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c4_04_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Cocinar con amigos es muy bonito.",
   "en": "Cooking with friends is lovely.",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c4_05_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí. Me siento bien aquí.",
   "en": "Yes. I feel good here.",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c4_06_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿Qué escribes en el cuaderno?",
   "en": "What are you writing in your notebook?",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c4_07_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "[[c4_apuntar|Apunto]] las palabras nuevas: sartén, bol, delantal…",
   "en": "I'm noting down the new words: frying pan, bowl, apron…",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c4_08_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Buena idea! ¿Vienes a otra clase?",
   "en": "Good idea! Are you coming to another class?",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c4_09_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Claro! Quiero otra clase.",
   "en": "Of course! I want another class.",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c4_10_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Yo también. Pues… ¡[[c4_hasta_pronto|hasta pronto]], Marina!",
   "en": "Me too. Well… see you soon, Marina!",
   "who": "Laura",
   "audio": "audio/c4_11_Laura.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Hasta pronto, Laura!",
   "en": "See you soon, Laura!",
   "who": "Marina",
   "audio": "audio/c4_12_Marina.mp3"
  },
  {
